        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: \"Computech\"\n- People: Turbonegro\n- Topics: Norwegian punk rock\n\nFacts:\n- Turbonegro is a Norwegian punk rock band known as Turboneger in Norway.\n- Turbonegro was initially active from 1989 to 1998 and reformed in 2002.\n- \"Computech\" is a single by Turbonegro released on cassette tape in 1989.\n- \"Computech\" was recorded at Turbonegro's first rehearsal in January 1989.\n- Only 50 copies of \"Computech\" were made, though some sources say 100 copies were made.",
